{"n": 923, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "923.webp", "text": "51-215\n\n5121200 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nOR REPLACING OUTSIDE\nHANDLE AND LOCKING\nMECHANISM OF LEFT OR\nRIGHT FRONT DOOR\n\nNote:\n\nSome pictures show the sheet metal parts cut\noff for better understanding.\n\nRemove door trim panel — see 51 41 001.\nPull off plastic sheet partially.\n\nInstallation:\nReplace damaged plastic sheet.\n\nUnscrew outside handle.\n\nfostallation:\nAlign outside handle that it rests on the rubber\npads.\n\nIf applicable, disconnect plug\n\nUnscrew nuts.\n\nRemove locking mechanism.\n\nCaution!\n\nBe careful not to damage paint at openings.\n\nInstallation:\nAlign locking mechanism with bead in the door\npanel after screwing on the outside handle.\n\nInstallation:\n\nIf applicable, the lifted outside handle must\noperate the heating control unit for the door\nlock or the contact transmitter for inside light\ndelayed action.\n\nIf applicable, adjust or bend the contact tongue.", "words": [["51-215", 0.46, 0.0225, 0.5258, 0.0477], ["5121200", 0.2594, 0.0637, 0.309, 0.0749], ["REMOVING", 0.3222, 0.0637, 0.3825, 0.0756], ["AND", 0.386, 0.065, 0.4103, 0.0756], ["INSTALLING", 0.4144, 0.0643, 0.4818, 0.0763], ["OR", 0.3222, 0.0802, 0.3374, 0.0908], ["REPLACING", 0.3419, 0.0796, 0.4048, 0.0915], ["OUTSIDE", 0.4088, 0.0802, 0.4569, 0.0915], ["HANDLE", 0.3222, 0.0955, 0.3678, 0.1074], ["AND", 0.3718, 0.0962, 0.3961, 0.1074], ["LOCKING", 0.4002, 0.0962, 0.4498, 0.1074], ["MECHANISM", 0.3222, 0.1114, 0.3891, 0.1233], ["OF", 0.3921, 0.1121, 0.4068, 0.1233], ["LEFT", 0.4113, 0.1121, 0.4382, 0.1233], ["OR", 0.4422, 0.1127, 0.458, 0.1233], ["RIGHT", 0.3222, 0.128, 0.3571, 0.1393], ["FRONT", 0.3612, 0.128, 0.3987, 0.1393], ["DOOR", 0.4032, 0.1286, 0.4341, 0.1399], ["Note:", 0.2594, 0.1598, 0.2862, 0.1711], ["Some", 0.2594, 0.1764, 0.2867, 0.187], ["pictures", 0.2898, 0.1764, 0.3278, 0.1897], ["show", 0.3313, 0.1771, 0.3551, 0.187], ["the", 0.3587, 0.1764, 0.3739, 0.187], ["sheet", 0.3769, 0.1